pleted":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The agent mode in Claude Sonnet 4 behaves strangely—it often fails to follow instructions correctly. Even when explicitly told not to do something, it does the opposite.\n\n1. **Ignoring Directives**\nIf you instruct it not to add comments, summaries, or explanations, it still inserts them.\nExample: You say \"No comments, just code\", yet it adds // This function does X or summary blocks.  \n\n2. **Unnecessary File Duplication**\nIt frequently creates redundant copies in folders like new, cleaned, or final, claiming the original code is \"corrupt\"  (even when it’s perfectly fine).\n\n3. **Weird Formatting Changes**\nIt alters code structure unnecessarily, like collapsing brackets:\n\nOriginal:\n```cs\n}    \n protected override ...\n ```\nAgent Mode Output:\n ```cs\n }    protected override ...\n ```\n\nPLEASE update it.","closed_by":{"login":"bhavyaus","id":25044782,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDQ0Nzgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25044782?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus","html_url":"https://github.com/bhavyaus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12872/reacti